\description{
Lays out a table of results the way a report presents them: one row per
sample, one column per analyte, with the guideline sets the results are
compared against written across the top. Returns a formatted \code{gt} table;
\code{\link[=results_table_to_excel]{results_table_to_excel()}} writes the same table to a workbook.
